      <k100:park>월출산</k100:park>
      <k100:mountain_ids>wolchulsan</k100:mountain_ids>
      <k100:geometry>OpenStreetMap ways matched to the official course path; no official coordinates included; short connectors (&lt;=30 m) only where OSM way ends do not meet and the official course passes</k100:geometry>
